                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2eac464f-bc95-30a3-a2b2-e2f3a43f25b0",
                        "entry_id": "46b94f25-8604-3e08-9862-3ca4784b6e10",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Not characteristic of the naval service; unseamanlike."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6ee464e6-651e-4678-9361-8d00e340b265",
                                "sense_id": "2eac464f-bc95-30a3-a2b2-e2f3a43f25b0",
                                "text": "The mate's unservicelike style of acquiescence — \"With much pleasure sir,\" rather surprised, if it did not actually disconcert our 'gallant post,' who for a few seconds stared at him with all his eyes, open mouthed to boot, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2f153de9-29de-4ccc-939c-5e65ab4f9a57",
                                "sense_id": "2eac464f-bc95-30a3-a2b2-e2f3a43f25b0",
                                "text": "The Borneons, in fighting, wear a quilted jacket or spencer, which reaches over the hips, and from its size has a most unservicelike appearance: the bare legs and arms sticking out from under this puffed-out coat, like the sticks which support the garments of a scarecrow."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5bf89b6c-3628-4bd0-bbf2-03a0704cac3c",
                                "sense_id": "2eac464f-bc95-30a3-a2b2-e2f3a43f25b0",
                                "text": "Malta could offer no replacements, so that many submariners with a natural pride in their uniform did not 'go ashore' when they could, because they looked so unservicelike."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
